{
 "id": "g13",
 "title": "用語聞き流し13 企業活動・会計",
 "summary": "企業活動・会計の頻出略語21語を、略語 → 間 → 正式名称と意味の順に読み上げます。",
 "related": [
  "../05_まとめ・横断資料/02_頻出略語・用語集.md"
 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "用語の聞き流し、企業活動・会計編なのだ。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "略語を読み上げたら、少し間をあけるわね。意味を思い浮かべてから答えを聞いてね。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "ROE。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Return On Equity。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "自己資本利益率（当期純利益 / 自己資本）",
   "yomi": "自己資本利益率、当期純利益 、 自己資本"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "ROA。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Return On Assets。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "総資産利益率（利益 / 総資産）",
   "yomi": "総資産利益率、利益 、 総資産"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "NPV。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Net Present Value。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "正味現在価値。将来のキャッシュフローの現在価値 − 投資額"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "IRR。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Internal Rate of Return。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "内部収益率。NPVが0になる割引率"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "EOQ。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Economic Order Quantity。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "経済的発注量。発注費と保管費の合計が最小になる発注量"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "JIT。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Just In Time。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "必要なものを必要なときに必要な量だけ生産する方式"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "MRP。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Material Requirements Planning。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "資材所要量計画"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "TQC / TQM。",
   "yomi": "ティーキューシー、ティーキューエム。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Total Quality Control / Management。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "全社的品質管理／総合的品質マネジメント",
   "yomi": "全社的品質管理、総合的品質マネジメント"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "QC。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Quality Control。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "品質管理（QC七つ道具：パレート図、特性要因図など）",
   "yomi": "品質管理、QC七つ道具：パレート図、特性要因図など"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "PDCA。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Plan, Do, Check, Act。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "計画・実行・評価・改善の管理サイクル"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "OODA。",
   "yomi": "ウーダ。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Observe, Orient, Decide, Act。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "観察・状況判断・意思決定・行動の意思決定サイクル"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "IE。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Industrial Engineering。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "作業や工程を分析・改善する生産工学"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "OR。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Operations Research。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "数理的手法で最適な意思決定を支援する"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "PL / P/L。",
   "yomi": "ピーエル。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Profit and Loss statement。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "損益計算書"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "BS / B/S。",
   "yomi": "ビーエス。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Balance Sheet。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "貸借対照表"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "CF / C/F。",
   "yomi": "シーエフ。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Cash Flow statement。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "キャッシュフロー計算書"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "CEO。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Chief Executive Officer。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "最高経営責任者"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "CIO。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Chief Information Officer。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "最高情報責任者。IT戦略の責任者"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "CISO。",
   "yomi": "シーソ。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Chief Information Security Officer。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "最高情報セキュリティ責任者"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "CFO。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Chief Financial Officer。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "最高財務責任者"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "HRM。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Human Resource Management。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "人的資源管理"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "企業活動・会計編は、ここまでよ。聞き取れなかった用語は、略語カードで復習してね。"
  }
 ]
}